claims:
1. A method, comprising:
in a teleoperations system in communication with an autonomous vehicle operating in an environment and remote from the teleoperations system, receiving con-text data collected by the autonomous vehicle from the environment in which the autonomous vehicle oper-ates;
presenting the received context data to a teleoperations system operator using a teleoperations user interface representing at least a portion of the environment to provide situational awareness to the teleoperations sys-tem operator;
presenting, within the teleoperations user interface, a virtual path suggestion constraint that constrains move-ment of the autonomous vehicle within the environ-ment based upon a physical attribute of the autonomous vehicle;
receiving a virtual path suggestion input defining a virtual path of travel from the teleoperations system operator through the teleoperations user interface; and
in the teleoperations system and in response to the virtual path suggestion input that defines the virtual path of travel, communicating path data to the autonomous vehicle to cause the autonomous vehicle to generate a path for the autonomous vehicle and to autonomously operate the autonomous vehicle.

20. A system, the system comprising one or more pro-cessors in a teleoperations system remotely located from an autonomous vehicle and configured to:
receive context data collected by the autonomous vehicle from an environment in which the autonomous vehicle operates;
present the received context data to a teleoperations system operator using a teleoperations user interface representing at least a portion of the environment to provide situational awareness to the teleoperations sys-tem operator;
present, within the teleoperations user interface, a virtual path suggestion constraint that constrains movement of the autonomous vehicle within the environment based upon a physical attribute of the autonomous vehicle;
receive a virtual path suggestion input defining a virtual path of travel from the teleoperations system operator through the teleoperations user interface; and
in response to the virtual path suggestion input that defines the virtual path of travel, communicate path data to the autonomous vehicle to cause the autono-mous vehicle to generate a path for the autonomous vehicle and to autonomously operate the autonomous vehicle to follow the virtual path of travel.
